      <title>Contemporary art at The Aldrich</title>
      <link>https://www.wshu.org/arts-culture/2026-01-28/contemporary-art-at-the-aldrich</link>
      <description>The Aldrich in Ridgefield, Connecticut, is unusual for a museum. It doesn’t have any permanent collections, and it features only contemporary artists and their work. WSHU’s Randye Kaye takes listeners on a guided tour through the museum’s galleries to discover what’s new in contemporary art.</description>
